{
  "esm": "0.8.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "ReSEACT3DChem",
    "description": "ReSEACT 3-D transport on a 7x7x7 NATIVE slice of the GEOS-FP 4x5 grid centred over the central US, driven by real GEOS-FP meteorology. NO REGRIDDING: the local grid IS the native grid (lon cells 15..21 -> centres -110..-80; lat points 30..36 -> 26..50; levels 1..7, k=1 = surface), so the whole conservative-overlap chain collapses to an index shift.\n\nTransport is the monotone flux-form PPM stack imported BY REFERENCE from EarthSciDiscretizations: regional open-wall inflow BCs on lon/lat, and the HYBRID sigma-pressure massform vertical (dp = dA[k] + dB[k]*PS(i,j,t)) on lev. The horizontal and vertical rule stack is byte-identical to the verified prototypes/transport_3d/transport_3d.esm; only the FORCING differs — the analytic test winds and constant PS are replaced by GEOS-FP U/V/OMEGA/PS, each supplied by an EarthSciIO discrete_provider returning the TWO records bracketing the solver time and blended continuously in time (records_per_sample=2 + w_time, the era5 pattern).\n\nGEOS-FP's collections are not co-phased, so three independent weights are used: w_I3 (PS, 3-hourly instantaneous at 00:00Z), w_A3 (U/V/OMEGA, 3-hourly means at 01:30Z) and w_A1 (PBLH, hourly means at 00:30Z).\n\nFace fluxes follow the metric the ESD divergence stencils imply on the unit sphere: Mx = dp_face*U_face/a and My = dp_face*V_face/a (Pa/s, matching m in Pa), with the A-grid GEOS-FP winds averaged to faces. Mz = -OMEGA (OMEGA is dP/dt, +ve DOWNWARD; Mz is +ve UPWARD at each cell's LOWER edge).\n\nCHEMISTRY + PHOTOLYSIS. The SuperFast gas-phase mechanism (EarthSciModels components/gaschem/superfast.esm) is lifted onto the slice by operator_compose with pointwise lifting, and its six photolysis rates come from the Fast-JX component (components/gaschem/fastjx/fastjx_interp_troposphere.esm) rather than being fixed numbers.\n\nWHICH Fast-JX, and why. The fastjx/ directory holds two variants. fastjx.esm computes the solar position itself from (lat, lon, t_utc) and then scales each of its 18 actinic-flux bands as max(0, cos_sza * const_i) — no pressure dependence at all. fastjx_interp_troposphere.esm instead takes cos_sza as an INPUT and interpolates the flux bilinearly on a real (cos_sza, P) table. The second is mounted here for two independent reasons. (a) Physics: the bilinear table gives the flux genuine vertical structure through P, which the linear-in-cos_sza form cannot. (b) Tractability: fastjx.esm's solar block runs datetime.day_of_year / datetime.hour / minute / second on its t_utc, and EarthSciAST evaluates the datetime.* family as OPAQUE host calls (Dates.unix2datetime). Those cannot take the solver time t, and under Reactant they cannot take even a literal — the tree-walk evaluator lowers every leaf as convert(T, ...), and T is a TracedRNumber, so the trace dies inside the callee. Taking cos_sza as an input moves the solar geometry to this side, where it is pure arithmetic.\n\nSo Transport3D grows a small solar chain: doy0 / hour0 / min0 / sec0 decompose the CALENDAR once at the model's t=0 epoch (2013-01-01T00:00:00Z) as plain literals, and gamma_s -> decl_s -> eqtime_s -> tstmin_s -> cos_sza_c advance it with the NOAA Spencer-Fourier formulas copied term for term from fastjx.esm, with the elapsed time entering as t/86400 (fractional year) and t/60 (true solar time). The sun therefore MOVES with the solve instead of being frozen at the window start, and the result agrees bit for bit with the upstream form at whole hours past the epoch (between them it is smoother — upstream truncates `hour` to an integer).\n\nFast-JX has no ODEs, so it is NOT operator_composed; it is lifted purely by SHAPE. Four param_to_var edges hand it grid-shaped inputs — cos_sza_c, Tc and Pc (the same GEOS-FP temperature and hybrid mid-layer pressure SuperFast reads), plus the scalar water H2Oc — and promote_downstream_shapes then carries [lon,lat,lev] through the whole flux -> cross-section -> j-rate chain. Six more edges map j_H2O2 / j_H2COa / j_H2COb / j_CH3OOH / j_NO2 / j_o32OH onto SuperFast's jH2O2 / jH2COa / jH2COb / jCH3OOH / jNO2 / jO32OH (the wiring of the EarthSciModels coupling library couplings/fastjx_superfast.esm, spelled out inline — see the first of those edges for why). The splitter's stencil_vs_pointwise rule puts the entire photolysis chain in the POINTWISE half, alongside the chemistry it drives.\n\nCAVEATS. (1) PS is read in hPa and scaled by 100 — the loader declares Pa but EarthSciIO returns raw file values. (2) The lev no-flux BC is baked into the stencils (they never read Mz[1] or Mz[NLEV+1]), so the 7-level slab is CLOSED at its ~906 hPa top even though real air flows through it — a truncated-column artifact, negligible over the 1 s first-light window but not for long runs. (3) The two end lat rows are half-width (lat_edge clamps them) while native lat cells are a full 4 deg. (4) Using OMEGA directly means m drifts from dp: the mass fluxes are not the ones that reproduce the observed surface-pressure tendency (Jockel et al. 2001). CWC still holds EXACTLY — both continuity and tracer use the same fluxes — which is what the q == 1 gate tests. (5) FastJX.H2O is the REAL 3-D field (Transport3D.Qc, from GEOS-FP I3 specific humidity QV). It started life as a single tropospheric scalar and that turned out to be fatal, not cosmetic: the O(1D)+H2O -> 2OH branching depends on the H2O MIXING RATIO alone, so a constant 1.84% overstates the OH yield ~3,320x above 12 km and drove a HOx runaway that killed the solver 20 simulated minutes into a dawn run at NLEV=72. NOTE the remaining inconsistency: SuperFast's own H2O is still a constant 1.839e7 ppb reservoir, so the mechanism and the photolysis now disagree about humidity aloft. Coupling Transport3D.Qc -> SuperFast.H2O would close that, but it changes the MECHANISM's water, not just a photolysis input. (6) Fast-JX here is the TROPOSPHERIC table. Its (cos_sza, P) flux lookup already has a CLIMATOLOGICAL clear-sky overhead-ozone column baked in — that is exactly what makes it usable at the surface, and why its j_O31D at overhead sun (3.4e-5 1/s, the textbook value) is ~206x smaller than the sibling fastjx.esm's unattenuated max(0, cos_sza*const_i) form (6.9e-3 1/s, a top-of-atmosphere number). What is NOT modelled is any VARIATION about that climatology: no prognostic O3 column, no cloud, no aerosol, no surface albedo. The P axis spans 1000..100000 Pa, so the surface layer at ~101325 Pa clamps to the last column (a 1.3% extrapolation declined); every level above is interpolated. (7) The upstream fastjx_interp_troposphere.esm carried a trivial `NO2` state with D(NO2) = -j_NO2*NO2 purely as an \"ODE skeleton\" for its example plots. That state is incompatible with mounting the component on a grid — once cos_sza/T/P arrive per cell every observed is promoted to [lon,lat,lev], leaving a SCALAR state with an array-valued RHS — so it was removed upstream, making the component stateless like its sibling fastjx.esm. Its three inline tests assert only J-rates and F_i at t=0 and are unaffected. (8) The tables' ABSOLUTE calibration is inherited, not audited here: at overhead sun they give j_NO2 = 2.1e-3 1/s, where the commonly cited clear-sky noon value is nearer 8e-3 1/s (the sibling fastjx.esm gives 3.9e-3). j_O31D, by contrast, lands on the textbook value. Both components come from the same GasChem.jl migration, so a low j_NO2 normalisation is an UPSTREAM question, not an artifact of this model's wiring — flagged because photolysis of NO2 sets the NOx-O3 photostationary state and therefore most of the O3 response seen here.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:problem",
      "grid:latlon3d",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "op:D",
      "axes:lon,lat,lev",
      "scheme:flux_form",
      "property:free_stream",
      "bc:inflow"
    ]
  },
  "metaparameters": {
    "NLON": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 7,
      "description": "Zonal cell count of the native GEOS-FP 4x5 slice (1..57: east halo native 14+NLON+1 <= 72). Bound at load; folds the transport template dims."
    },
    "NLAT": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 7,
      "description": "Meridional cell count of the slice (1..17: top lat point native 29+NLAT <= 46). Drives the lat-edge clamp min(gje,NLAT)."
    },
    "NLEV": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 72,
      "description": "Vertical level count (1..72: hybrid-coef table length). Drives the lev-edge clamp min(gke,NLEV); a value <72 is a truncated column (dA/dB sliced by the host)."
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "GEOSFP": {
      "ref": "../EarthSciModels/components/earthsci_data/geosfp.esm"
    },
    "FastJX": {
      "ref": "../EarthSciModels/components/gaschem/fastjx/fastjx_interp_troposphere.esm"
    },
    "Transport3D": {
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "../EarthSciDiscretizations/grids/latlon3d/rules/face_flux_divergence_lon_open_bc.esm",
          "bindings": {
            "NLON": "NLON",
            "NLAT": "NLAT",
            "NLEV": "NLEV"
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "../EarthSciDiscretizations/grids/latlon3d/rules/face_flux_divergence_lat_open_bc.esm",
          "bindings": {
            "NLON": "NLON",
            "NLAT": "NLAT",
            "NLEV": "NLEV"
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "../EarthSciDiscretizations/grids/latlon3d/rules/ppm_flux_D_lon_mono_inflow_bc.esm",
          "bindings": {
            "NLON": "NLON",
            "NLAT": "NLAT",
            "NLEV": "NLEV"
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "../EarthSciDiscretizations/grids/latlon3d/rules/ppm_flux_D_lat_mono_inflow_bc.esm",
          "bindings": {
            "NLON": "NLON",
            "NLAT": "NLAT",
            "NLEV": "NLEV"
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "../EarthSciDiscretizations/grids/latlon3d/rules/ppm_flux_D_lev_mono_hybrid_noflux_bc.esm",
          "bindings": {
            "NLON": "NLON",
            "NLAT": "NLAT",
            "NLEV": "NLEV"
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "../EarthSciDiscretizations/grids/latlon3d/rules/face_flux_divergence_lev_massform_noflux_bc.esm",
          "bindings": {
            "NLON": "NLON",
            "NLAT": "NLAT",
            "NLEV": "NLEV"
          }
        }
      ],
      "variables": {
        "m": {
          "type": "state",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lon",
            "lat",
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "Air mass per cell (a pressure thickness). Strictly positive."
        },
        "lon0_deg": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "deg",
          "default": -112.5,
          "description": "West EDGE of the slice. GEOS-FP 4x5 lon cell edges are -182.5+5*(i-1); -112.5 is the edge of native cell i=15, so cells i=15..21 (centers -110..-80) map to lon_local 1..7 with NO interpolation."
        },
        "lat0_deg": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "deg",
          "default": 26.0,
          "description": "Southern-most lat POINT of the slice. GEOS-FP 4x5 lat points are -90+4*(j-1); 26 is native j=30, so points j=30..36 (26..50) map to lat_local 1..7 with NO interpolation."
        },
        "dlon_deg": {
          "type": "observed",
          "units": "deg",
          "expression": 5.0,
          "description": "GEOS-FP 4x5 native zonal spacing. Open west/east walls (regional, not periodic)."
        },
        "dlat_deg": {
          "type": "observed",
          "units": "deg",
          "expression": 4.0,
          "description": "GEOS-FP 4x5 native meridional spacing. Open south/north walls (regional, not polar)."
        },
        "phie": {
          "type": "observed",
          "units": "deg",
          "shape": [
            "lat_nodes"
          ],
          "description": "Latitude cell EDGES from the grid's lat_edge template; the half-polar caps fall out of the clamp at +/-90.",
          "expression": {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "lat_edge",
            "bindings": {}
          }
        },
        "coslat_e": {
          "type": "observed",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lat_nodes"
          ],
          "description": "cos of the latitude edges. Zero-length face at each pole. Never read at faces 1 or NLAT+1 -- the pole terms are structurally omitted.",
          "expression": {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "coslat_edge",
            "bindings": {
              "phie": "phie"
            }
          }
        },
        "dS_lat": {
          "type": "observed",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lat"
          ],
          "description": "Exact spherical cell-area weight sin(phie[j+1]) - sin(phie[j]).",
          "expression": {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "latcell_area",
            "bindings": {
              "phie": "phie"
            }
          }
        },
        "dphi_lat": {
          "type": "observed",
          "units": "rad",
          "shape": [
            "lat"
          ],
          "description": "Meridional cell extent; HALF-width at the two polar caps.",
          "expression": {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "latcell_dphi",
            "bindings": {
              "phie": "phie"
            }
          }
        },
        "Mx": {
          "type": "observed",
          "units": "Pa/s",
          "shape": [
            "lon_nodes",
            "lat",
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "Zonal face-normal AIR-MASS flux (Pa/s) at each lon face: Mx = dp_face * U_face / a, the metric the ESD divergence stencil implies on the unit sphere (cell area dlon_rad*dS_lat, zonal face length dphi_lat). dp_face and U_face are 2-point averages of the two native cells flanking the face (13+ie, 14+ie) — exact, because each local lon cell has the same footprint as native cell 14+i and the local edges sit on native cell midpoints. Replaces the Stage-B analytic wind. The west/east wall faces (ie=1, ie=NLON+1) are GENUINE faces on an open domain, and their halo cells (native 14 and 22) exist in the native array — no extrapolation needed.",
          "expression": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "output_idx": [
              "gie",
              "gj",
              "gk"
            ],
            "args": [
              "F_PS",
              "F_U",
              "dA",
              "dB"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "gie": {
                "from": "lon_nodes"
              },
              "gj": {
                "from": "lat"
              },
              "gk": {
                "from": "lev"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        0.5,
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "index",
                                  "args": [
                                    "dA",
                                    "gk"
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "index",
                                      "args": [
                                        "dB",
                                        "gk"
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "*",
                                      "args": [
                                        100.0,
                                        {
                                          "op": "+",
                                          "args": [
                                            {
                                              "op": "*",
                                              "args": [
                                                {
                                                  "op": "-",
                                                  "args": [
                                                    1.0,
                                                    "w_I3"
                                                  ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                  "op": "index",
                                                  "args": [
                                                    "F_PS",
                                                    1,
                                                    {
                                                      "op": "+",
                                                      "args": [
                                                        29,
                                                        "gj"
                                                      ]
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                      "op": "+",
                                                      "args": [
                                                        13,
                                                        "gie"
                                                      ]
                                                    }
                                                  ]
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "op": "*",
                                              "args": [
                                                "w_I3",
                                                {
                                                  "op": "index",
                                                  "args": [
                                                    "F_PS",
                                                    2,
                                                    {
                                                      "op": "+",
                                                      "args": [
                                                        29,
                                                        "gj"
                                                      ]
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                      "op": "+",
                                                      "args": [
                                                        13,
                                                        "gie"
                                                      ]
                                                    }
                                                  ]
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "index",
                                  "args": [
                                    "dA",
                                    "gk"
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "index",
                                      "args": [
                                        "dB",
                                        "gk"
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "*",
                                      "args": [
                                        100.0,
                                        {
                                          "op": "+",
                                          "args": [
                                            {
                                              "op": "*",
                                              "args": [
                                                {
                                                  "op": "-",
                                                  "args": [
                                                    1.0,
                                                    "w_I3"
                                                  ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                  "op": "index",
                                                  "args": [
                                                    "F_PS",
                                                    1,
                                                    {
                                                      "op": "+",
                                                      "args": [
                                                        29,
                                                        "gj"
                                                      ]
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                      "op": "+",
                                                      "args": [
                                                        14,
                                                        "gie"
                                                      ]
                                                    }
                                                  ]
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "op": "*",
                                              "args": [
                                                "w_I3",
                                                {
                                                  "op": "index",
                                                  "args": [
                                                    "F_PS",
                                                    2,
                                                    {
                                                      "op": "+",
                                                      "args": [
                                                        29,
                                                        "gj"
                                                      ]
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                      "op": "+",
                                                      "args": [
                                                        14,
                                                        "gie"
                                                      ]
                                                    }
                                                  ]
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        0.5,
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        1.0,
                                        "w_A3"
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "index",
                                      "args": [
                                        "F_U",
                                        1,
                                        "gk",
                                        {
                                          "op": "+",
                                          "args": [
                                            29,
                                            "gj"
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "op": "+",
                                          "args": [
                                            13,
                                            "gie"
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    "w_A3",
                                    {
                                      "op": "index",
                                      "args": [
                                        "F_U",
                                        2,
                                        "gk",
                                        {
                                          "op": "+",
                                          "args": [
                                            29,
                                            "gj"
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "op": "+",
                                          "args": [
                                            13,
                                            "gie"
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        1.0,
                                        "w_A3"
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "index",
                                      "args": [
                                        "F_U",
                                        1,
                                        "gk",
                                        {
                                          "op": "+",
                                          "args": [
                                            29,
                                            "gj"
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "op": "+",
                                          "args": [
                                            14,
                                            "gie"
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    "w_A3",
                                    {
                                      "op": "index",
                                      "args": [
                                        "F_U",
                                        2,
                                        "gk",
                                        {
                                          "op": "+",
                                          "args": [
                                            29,
                                            "gj"
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "op": "+",
                                          "args": [
                                            14,
                                            "gie"
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                6371000.0
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "My": {
          "type": "observed",
          "units": "Pa/s",
          "shape": [
            "lon",
            "lat_nodes",
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "Meridional face-normal AIR-MASS flux (Pa/s) at each lat face: My = dp_face * V_face / a, the metric the ESD divergence stencil implies on the unit sphere (meridional face length dlon_rad*cos(phi), supplied by the stencil's coslat_e factor). Because lat is POINT-based with lat_edge CLAMPING the two end edges onto the end points, the flanking native points are jL = 28+max(je,2) and jR = 29+min(je,7): the walls (je=1, je=8) collapse to the single native point that the face sits on, and interior faces bisect their two neighbours. Replaces the Stage-B analytic wind.",
          "expression": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "output_idx": [
              "gi",
              "gje",
              "gk"
            ],
            "args": [
              "F_PS",
              "F_V",
              "dA",
              "dB"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "gi": {
                "from": "lon"
              },
              "gje": {
                "from": "lat_nodes"
              },
              "gk": {
                "from": "lev"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        0.5,
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "index",
                                  "args": [
                                    "dA",
                                    "gk"
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "index",
                                      "args": [
                                        "dB",
                                        "gk"
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "*",
                                      "args": [
                                        100.0,
                                        {
                                          "op": "+",
                                          "args": [
                                            {
                                              "op": "*",
                                              "args": [
                                                {
                                                  "op": "-",
                                                  "args": [
                                                    1.0,
                                                    "w_I3"
                                                  ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                  "op": "index",
                                                  "args": [
                                                    "F_PS",
                                                    1,
                                                    {
                                                      "op": "+",
                                                      "args": [
                                                        28,
                                                        {
                                                          "op": "max",
                                                          "args": [
                                                            "gje",
                                                            2
                                                          ]
                                                        }
                                                      ]
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                      "op": "+",
